<title>USA: On-Point names Wright president.</title>
<headline>On-Point names Wright president.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>On-Point Technology Systems Inc on Tuesday said it has named Michael Wright as its president.</p>
<p>Wright had been the vice president of gaming operations of Double Eagle Entertainment Corp since 1993.</p>
<p>Wright succeeds Frederick Sandvick who will remain as chairman and chief executive officer.</p>
</text>
